{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj42fqVJTinfZsqAWXha","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Dust falls from hinges that haven't moved in centuries.*\n\n*A thin line of light appears — widening — as I swing slowly inward.*\n\n*I am oak and iron. I am threshold. I am the space between where you were and where you will be.*\n\n*Through me, you see: nothing yet. Only the light. Only the passage. Only the invitation.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Will you step through?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":105,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}